  "collateral": "Tokenized cash-equivalent reserves held by governance-approved enshrined custodians, each of which mints and redeems frxUSD 1:1 against reserves it holds on-chain. The observed balance sheet is WisdomTree WTGXX (U.S. government money market), Superstate USTB (T-bills), BlackRock BUIDL (U.S. Treasuries/repos via Securitize), Bridge USDB, and a segregated Erebor Bank reserve account. Governance has additionally approved Superstate USCC (FIP-420), Agora AUSD (FIP-425), Centrifuge JTRSY (FIP-426), and Circle USDC as custodian assets, but no balances have been observed for them beyond dust USDC in the redemption contract.",
